WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:04.792
Determine word meaning from how it is used, rather than selecting a dictionary sense

00:00:04.792 --> 00:00:05.448
at random.

00:00:06.283 --> 00:00:11.118
“Ama was relieved when she found her missing key.” Relieved means what? Answer: No

00:00:11.118 --> 00:00:11.809
longer worried

00:00:12.617 --> 00:00:17.118
Find two words with more than one meaning and explain the sense used in a passage.

00:00:17.950 --> 00:00:20.489
Discuss why: Finding the key removes worry.
